          "title": "You'll want to know: fugō, fugāre",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "fugō, fugāre — \"to put to flight, to rout\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Equitēs nostrī hostēs fugāvērunt. Our cavalry put the enemy to flight."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "fugō, fugāre, fugāvī, fugātum: to make others run."
