              "text": "superō, superāre — \"to overcome, to defeat; to surpass\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Parva manus magnum exercitum superāvit. A small band defeated a large army."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "superō, superāre, superāvī, superātum, from super, 'above'. Also to climb over: montēs superāre."
            }
          ]
        },
